>\n<p>When you imagined the following concepts, did you understand they don't really exist in our reality: &quot;sharing&quot; &quot;equality&quot; &quot;fairness&quot; &quot;charity&quot;...</p>\n<p>How long are you willing to ignore the collapse of civilization to defend your delusion?</p>\n<p>What, specifically, is &quot;work?&quot;</p>\n<p>What, objectively and in the visible sense, are beauty and ugliness? Show me an image of each, and explain why they are visually beautiful and ugly.</p>\n<p>Are men allowed to have standards and/or preferences?</p>\n<p>Are you capable of stating plainly what you mean, want, or believe?</p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n<p>Men</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 11, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVCm89En", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 25, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "hunter", "id": 8822759, "raw_content": "", "author": "ErikaLives", "created": 1788834512735, "profile_picture": "Meps3xVbHc80", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "comply863", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVCm89En.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/dks53erfhfC3.gif", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/OKDWJgVSLK3hsk5o.mp4", "width": 428, "content-type": "mp4", "height": 270}], "blurhash": "UABWiD={R3-=%%RjE1Sj00WXxvIT8wxa%Mi]", "full_resolution": [270, 428]}, "title": "Have they released pics of the jeet pilots who crashed the Amazon carg